                <mxCell id="vss-title" value="VSS Key Distribution" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontColor=#ff6d5a;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono, monospace;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104" y="668" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
                <mxCell id="vss-body" value="CKKS context secret key is split into 3 shares (additive VSS with SHA-256 commitments).
Each client holds one share. All 3 shares required to reconstruct the key.
Tampered share is caught immediately — guilty client named by commitment mismatch." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=10;fontColor=#888888;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono, monospace;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104" y="692" width="820" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
