                <mxCell id="mtls-title" value="mTLS + Ed25519 Signing" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontColor=#6366f1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono, monospace;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1004" y="668" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
                <mxCell id="mtls-body" value="Server acts as CA — issues client certificates at enrollment.
CA only online during enrollment, not during training rounds.
Each gradient update is Ed25519-signed using the enrollment keypair for non-repudiation." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=10;fontColor=#888888;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono, monospace;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1004" y="692" width="820" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
